Choate -> Winsor[label="10.1 (11.22)
04/22", weight="90", tooltip="NEIRA Girls , Winsor School vs. Choate vs. NCDS			
Distance: 1350 Conditions: 
Fantastic racing on the busy powerhouse this Wednesday afternoon! Thank you to Choate for coming up and to NCDS for pivoting with some last minute schedule adjustments. 
13mph steady head wind with a bit of chop for the last 400m, wind increased as racing went on and conditions slowed. 
Order of racing: Novice 8+, G2, G3, G4, G5, G1. Comments: 6th boat: Novice 8+ of NCDS / Winsor
